[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7141.03, "timestamp": "01:59:01", "text": "奉献"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7143.83, "timestamp": "01:59:03", "text": "对所有这些人来说，这都很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7145.43, "timestamp": "01:59:05", "text": "活动、管理社区和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7147.109, "timestamp": "01:59:07", "text": "一切。而且，这也很不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7149.43, "timestamp": "01:59:09", "text": "这也是一次学习经历，因为它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7151.03, "timestamp": "01:59:11", "text": "它自身也面临着一些挑战和问题。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7154.31, "timestamp": "01:59:14", "text": "做这件事还挺有意思的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7156.35, "timestamp": "01:59:16", "text": "知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7160.109, "timestamp": "01:59:20", "text": "是的。但我心中仍有疑虑。发生了什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7163.669, "timestamp": "01:59:23", "text": "你是不是辞职了？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7166.229, "timestamp": "01:59:26", "text": "你走了吗？是的，你基本可以这么说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7168.31, "timestamp": "01:59:28", "text": "那。我最终还是穿上了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7171.03, "timestamp": "01:59:31", "text": "管道。呃，有时候也许会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7173.51, "timestamp": "01:59:33", "text": "偶尔会，但也仅此而已。不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7177.43, "timestamp": "01:59:37", "text": "放松，别紧张。放松一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7180.87, "timestamp": "01:59:40", "text": "是的。是的。我仍然记得它就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7183.91, "timestamp": "01:59:43", "text": "昨天你来的时候，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7185.51, "timestamp": "01:59:45", "text": "准备你的首次直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7188.47, "timestamp": "01:59:48", "text": "现在一切都结束了。我的天啊。你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7190.87, "timestamp": "01:59:50", "text": "你发的广告东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7193.75, "timestamp": "01:59:53", "text": "就像横幅上写的那样，那就是你和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7197.149, "timestamp": "01:59:57", "text": "梗图之类的东西"}]